# Who owns which files. Single source of truth for the team (and for Claude, see CLAUDE.md).
#
# Format:  <path-pattern>   <owner>
#   owner   = tanay | aditya | darshil | shared
#   pattern = glob relative to the repo root; a pattern ending in "/" means "everything under it".
#   The LAST matching line wins, so put general rules first and specific ones after.
#
# Rules:
#   - Only the owner edits an owned file. Need a change? Ask the owner (see docs/WORK_PLAN.md §6).
#   - "shared" files are contracts. Change them only in a small PR titled "[contract] ..."
#     that every teammate knows about, and merge it fast.
#   - .claude/hooks/check_ownership.py reads this file and makes Claude ask before editing
#     a file that isn't yours.

